  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>venetoclax</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>L01XX52</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, oral dosing <small>(PK_1C_enteral)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Liu Z et al. 2026</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>Chinese patients with hematological malignancies</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>venetoclax</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_venetoclax/Venetoclax_Liu2026_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>CL/F (L/h)</td><td>7.33</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>Vd/F (L)</td><td>181</td><td>L</td><td><small>V/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>Ka (/h)</td><td>0.16</td><td>/h</td><td><small>kabs</small></td></tr></table><h4>About venetoclax</h4><p>Venetoclax is an anticancer medicine used to treat blood cancers such as chronic lymphocytic leukemia, acute myeloid leukemia, and certain B-cell lymphomas. It is an approved medicine and is authorised in the European Union for chronic lymphocytic leukemia.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q23671272\">Wikidata Q23671272</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Venetoclax\">Venetoclax</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Liu Z et al. (2026). Real-World Pharmacokinetic and Exposure-Response Characterization of Venetoclax in Chinese Patients with Hematological Malignancies. <i>Drug design, development and therapy 20:563629</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.2147/DDDT.S563629\">10.2147/DDDT.S563629</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41878678\">41878678</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Liu_2026: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
